  "handoff": {
    "S36": [
      "Use exact MP curves.",
      "Strong Defence EA is 20/25/30/35/40/50. Flat DEF mapping is approved reconstruction calibrated to original data, not recovered server arithmetic.",
      "Burst EA 10/15/20/25/30/35 and EC 5/7/10/12/15/17 support approved ATK-up/DEF-down calibration; concrete ATK/MaxHP/DEF mapping remains RECONSTRUCTION_POLICY.",
      "Sacrifice EA exactly matches 15/18/22/26/30/35; retain periodic HP-loss policy."
    ],
    "S37": [
      "Consume exact Dist/Area/MP curves.",
      "Poison supports immediate first damage plus later fixed half damage historically; do not claim EC=tick count.",
      "About 6s poison cadence is only RECOVERED_SECONDARY + RECONSTRUCTION_POLICY when tied to the existing ~500ms battle tick.",
